    "storyline": {
      "real": "A driveshaft failure in qualifying leaves Verstappen fifteenth on the grid, with P\u00e9rez on pole. P\u00e9rez takes the lead back from Alonso on lap 4 while Verstappen climbs into the top four. Stroll's stopped car brings out the safety car, and the leaders all pit for hards under it. Verstappen restarts fourth, passes Russell and Alonso, and chips away at a 5.4 s gap, but a driveshaft worry costs him time and P\u00e9rez wins by 5.355 s.",
