    "briefing": "Jeddah, 2023. A driveshaft failure in qualifying put Verstappen fifteenth on the grid, and P\u00e9rez started on pole. Fifteen laps in, you run Verstappen sixth on mediums, 21.4 s behind P\u00e9rez, and the cars around you have started to stop. Finish second at least, and if you can, beat your team-mate."
